# ZKP Online Voting System

This project is a zero-knowledge based anonymous online voting system using Circom, snarkjs, Node.js, and Express.

## Features
- Anonymous voter eligibility proof
- Merkle tree based voter membership verification
- Nullifier-based double voting prevention
- Groth16 proof generation and verification
- Minimal backend vote verification API

## Project Structure
- `circuits/` - Circom circuit files
- `scripts/` - input generation scripts
- `build/` - compiled artifacts
- `backend/` - backend verification server

## Requirements
- Node.js
- Circom 2.x
- snarkjs

